<!--Post: 4731--><!--Time: 1106698196-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4731"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Stealth<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Stealth<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, January 25, 2005 - 4:09 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Let’s take the 1974 incidents on their own.  Try to forget the Crazed Pervert Serial Killer for a second.  Let’s look at the facts, not the facts with explanations. <BR> <BR>Early January 1974 <BR>Joe Otero becomes fearful for his family’s safety to the point of seeming paranoid <BR>Joe Otero’s car disappears <BR>Joe Otero gets a rib injury <BR> <BR>January 12: Michael Williams gets critically shot by two assailants, shooters escape. <BR> <BR>January 15: Otero family is murdered <BR> <BR>March 28:  Michael Williams is home is robbed of at least a rifle and radio.  Michael Williams subsequently destroys finger print evidence before police can collect it. <BR> <BR>April 4: Kathryn Bright is killed.  Kevin Bright is tied up, while being strangled and still tied up by the same guy that killed Joe Otero, manages to grab the killer’s gun, pulls the trigger twice but it doesn’t fire, Killer shoots twice and it does fire, Kevin is shot in the face and escapes.  Tell passers by: “There’s a guy inside doing a job on my sister.” <BR> <BR>Drugs found in Bright home. Robert Beattie claims 5 casings are found in the house &#40;credible?&#41;.  <BR> <BR>Joe Otero has a girlfriend on the side <BR>Joe Otero has an import/export business on the side <BR>Joe Otero knows judo and is a recently retired 20 year military veteran who works at an airfield. <BR> <BR>Julie Otero worked for Coleman December 73-January 74 <BR>   <BR>Michael Williams is a 26 y/o supervisor for Coleman of all of these people. <BR>Michael Williams father was the HR manager for Coleman <BR> <BR>Kevin Bright 19 y/o began working for Coleman in March 1973 and quit in June to take a vacation.  Records show he was rehired to do the same job in July and quit in August.   <BR> <BR>Kathryn Bright 21 y/o worked at Coleman August 1973-April 1974. <BR> <BR>Bright case has never fit quite right. <BR> <BR>The 1974 letter does not address Bright, who has already been killed. <BR>What if the BTK letter never came pointing to a crazed stalking serial killer with no connections to Coleman? <BR>We know BTK likes to use misdirection <BR>-Motivation – If your looking for a sex pervert, why look too hard for a criminal enterprise motive?  <BR>-Accomplices - I did it alone.  Why would LE look too hard to connect two people? <BR> <BR>“So, the motive for the first attack is more direct than the later attacks, probably.  However, he found that he liked killing, he liked the domination and sense of release/relief that came with it, and he liked the empowerment most of all.”- Mike Kelleher <BR> <BR>Did it all start as a criminal enterprise gone bad? Theft of merchandise from Coleman plant for possible export? Drugs?   Have we been looking for the Coleman connection from the wrong direction?  Is it a social connection? <BR> <BR>Do Mike Williams and Kevin Bright know more than they have told?  Do they have their own motivations for not identifying BTK?   <BR> <BR>Is Kelleher right and that Vian, Fox, Wegerle, A. Williams are later results of BTK’s uncontrollable urges?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 4731-->
<!--Post: 4742--><!--Time: 1106705809-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4742"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->George<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->George<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->7-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, January 25, 2005 - 6:16 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->This is thought out and I&#39;m glad so many people are presenting theories. I have to say that I believe BTK, murder/sex pervert still holds sway. The Coleman information is compelling. Let me suggest a few problems I have. <BR> <BR> -- Vian, Fox, Wegerle and Williams can be conveniently explained. -- I see the Otero crime scene as nothing except a murderous sex crime. No other explanation, given what was found, makes sense to me. -- For one with uncontrollable urges <BR>BTK spaced his attacks well and each attack was extensively premeditated. Premeditation negates a lack of impulse control. -- I don&#39;t think the memories of Kevin Bright can be taken too seriously. -- Same thing for Charlie Otero. -- Need to know the quantity of drugs at the Bright scene. If they had enough to sell, that would be interesting.  <BR> <BR>The theory does make some sense, I can&#39;t deny it. &#40;With the exception of BTK losing control yet still carefully planning the later attacks.&#41; <BR> <BR>Nice thinking, thanks for putting down the theory!<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 4742-->
<!--Post: 4748--><!--Time: 1106708233-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4748"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Stealth<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Stealth<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, January 25, 2005 - 6:57 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->&#34;I have to say that I believe BTK, murder/sex pervert still holds sway.&#34; <BR> <BR>Who&#39;s to say they are mutualy exclusive? I only asked you to take step back to look at the early picture.  Murdering sex perverts have to start somewhere.  Perhaps he had a plan his compatriot never saw coming.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 4748-->
<!--Post: 6871--><!--Time: 1108058039-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6871"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Itty<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Itty<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 10, 2005 - 9:53 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->The police say Kathryn is a btk victim. Beattie says there were 5 casings at the scene. We know of the gun being fired, or trying to be fired 4 times. 2 by Kevin, 2 by the souless one. Maybe the extra casing&#40;s&#41; tie him to another btk crime, and thats why LE is sure.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
