<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6943"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Suspiria_2<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Suspiria_2<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 10, 2005 - 5:44 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->michael williams bothers me.  could someone kindly point me in the direction of any news articles which mention his case specifically. <BR> <BR>i find it odd that he would destroy evidence in such a way.  it makes it seem that he is merely making up the story about being robbed, although i guess i will have to look at the &#40;hopefully&#41; ensuing links to clear that up. <BR> <BR>thanks!<!--/Text--></td></tr>
